  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for 30 seconds.",
    "Stir in diced onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger, sauté for another minute.",
    "Pour in plum jam and stir until caramelized, about 2 minutes.",
    "Mix in toasted almonds and stir to coat with the jam mixture.",
    "Add dashi extract, vegetable water, coriander powder, garam masala, and salt; bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Cover and cook for 10 minutes until the flavors meld and the mixture becomes fluffy.",
    "Remove from heat, fluff with a fork, and serve hot."
